s=\"calibre2\"><img src=\"index-26_1.png\" class=\"calibre1\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\">Kate is ecstatic. </p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\">“But what was he doing at Clayton’s?” \r\ne. </p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\"/>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\"><img src=\"index-38_1.png\" class=\"calibre1\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\"> <i class=\"calibre3\">Kiss me damn it! </i>  I implore him, but I can’t move.  I’m\r\n.” </p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\"/>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\"><img src=\"index-41_1.png\" class=\"calibre1\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"calibre2\">Do I need a visual reminder of the beautiful Christian  <i class=\"calibre3\">I-don\r\n"}
